A '''Minos Champion''' is a [[Mythological Creature]] that can be spawned from [[Griffin Burrows]] during the [[Mythological Ritual]].

== Spawning ==
A '''Minos Champion''' has a chance to spawn when digging [[Griffin Burrows]] with an {{Epic}} or higher {{Item|Griffin Pet}} equipped.

