== Behavior ==
The '''Minos Champion''' can attack using a sword for melee attacks or a bow for ranged damage. It gains roughly 3-4% of a {{Stat|damage}} buff for each second it's lived for, capping at {{Red|600%}}. If the Minos Champion is unable to reach the player while in the 10 block range after a certain time, it will spawn a cross of Iron Blocks and strike lighting on the player once, similar to the [[Gaia Construct]]. 

